<title>BELGIUM: Europeans feeling unsafe after dark.</title>
<headline>Europeans feeling unsafe after dark.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the percentage of people in the European Union who said in an EU survey they felt unsafe walking in their own neighbourhood after dark:</p>
<p>    EUROPE UNION				   32 percent</p>
<p>    Austria					  20</p>
<p>    Belgium					  29</p>
<p>    Britain					  31</p>
<p>    Denmark					  11</p>
<p>    Finland					  13</p>
<p>    France					   29</p>
<p>    Germany (East)				 60</p>
<p>    Germany (West)				 34</p>
<p>    Greece					   28</p>
<p>    Ireland					  37</p>
<p>    Italy					    32</p>
<p>    Luxembourg				     18</p>
<p>    Netherlands				    19</p>
<p>    Portugal					 34</p>
<p>    Spain					    39</p>
<p>    Sweden					   19</p>
</text>
